Neutral wizards can get long sword unrestricted at crowning by
having a +FoD in your open inventory during a prayer.  Any
character wizard or otherwise is likely to get long sword
unrestricted at some point because more artifacts are of that
type than any other class.

Sunsword is a permanent short range light source.  Since wizards
are range combat characters who should avoid melee combat,
having it until Magicbane comes along isn't a bad use.  Use it to
remind yourself to avoid combat.  Hey, who ever heard of cutting
your finger on a flashlight?  ;^)



